{"version":1,"content":"<p>馮德倫、袁澧林、胡杏兒、周秀娜今晚（3日）到尖沙咀出席電影《第四幕》首映禮，袁澧林回應早前在社交平台撰長文揭露遭遇圈中性騷擾，目的並非要剷除害群之馬，或公審任何人，而是希望引起廣泛關注現象及深層次討論。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:02:19.581904+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T14:07:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T16:38:18.576347+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:59:06.888262+00:00","content_hash":"dce368139b2d2d3fdf2b466a094c2a999b21f034eb3d63220551fcdf3c37bf7b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}